OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 83, dies after being hit by
OL,4,Abus                                    
OL,6,FAn 83-year-old woman has died after she
OL,7,Fwas hit by a bus in Grimsby.           
OL,9,FHumberside Police said officers were   
OL,10,Fcalled at about 10:20 GMT on Friday to 
OL,11,Freports that a double-decker bus that  
OL,12,Fwas turning right from Broadway onto   
OL,13,FLaceby Road had collided with a        
OL,14,Fpedestrian.                            
OL,16,FThe woman died at the scene and her    
OL,17,Ffamily are being supported by specially
OL,18,Ftrained officers, police said.         
OL,20,FThe force asked for witnesses or anyone
OL,21,Fwith dashcam footage to get in touch.  
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
